soners from Poland and Western Europe. This uprising resulted in being the only successful one throughout the war, which led to the largest escape of prisoners from a Nazi concentration camp.","tagline":"Based On a True Story That Changed The World"},{"language":"ru-RU","overview":"История сопротивления человеческого духа бездушной машине уничтожения. В октябре 1943 года заключённые лагеря Собибор во главе с лейтенантом Красной Армии Александром Печерским поднимают восстание — единственное успешное восстание в нацистском лагере смерти.","tagline":"Подвиг, который мы забыли"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fEB0ey4XPhLHKjKv9QL2erXoZOc.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zjVz2XCXKwb0FX8qge1LbTd80H.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":440626,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fEB0ey4XPhLHKjKv9QL2erXoZOc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fEB0ey4XPhLHKjKv9QL2erXoZOc.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fEB0ey4XPhLHKjKv9QL2erXoZOc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fEB0ey4XPhLHKjKv9QL2erXoZOc.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rg7CylFDlgjRQDyuskLMkPzqI5N.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rg7CylFDlgjRQDyuskLMkPzqI5N.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uSDfmIUqPgBgKmwrFOXT32VIPlE.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uSDfmIUqPgBgKmwrFOXT32VIPlE.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dnexT2if0lRTp8jsGSOY4JVAnnj.jpg",